# model files are downloads, never committed
models/*
!models/MANIFEST.md
# and no model file may be committed from anywhere else either: an hf download
# run with the repo root as its working directory has already dropped a
# 9.35 GB encoder into ./text_encoders/ once (2026-09-22), and it was not
# ignored at the time
*.safetensors
*.gguf
*.ckpt
# hf CLI cache, created wherever hf download is invoked
.cache/
# runner binary
bin/
# generated test images
out/
# rust build output
target/
# knowledge-graph and index build output
graphify-rs-out/
graphify-out/
.rag-index/
.callgraph-index.bin
# logs
*.log